    "body": "SakiSU 4.3 production release.\n\n- Restores safe vendor_boot rmvr support for exact vr/vklp kernel modules.\n- Keeps dynamic vermagic adaptation.\n- Fixes SakiSU production-manager trust classification and authorization compatibility.\n- Restores the independent SakiSU user-facing baseline.\n- Hardens release signing and final APK verification.\n\nPublished APKs are signed with the SakiSU production certificate (SHA-256: f5391718452b269336a4cf0077b2fc4f9ae91253f061126a2708d5017134287c)."
